# Utopia Sprawl: "Enchant Forest" (CR 702.5a, 303.4a) makes a Mountain no legal target, while a Forest of either player's is
# (the positive control). Bot1 casts it on Bot2's Forest and chooses blue as it enters (CR 614.12a). "Whenever enchanted
# Forest is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of the chosen color": a triggered mana ability (CR
# 605.1b, 106.12a) that resolves at once, and "its controller" is the Forest's, so when Bot2 taps the Forest, Bot2 has {G}{U}
# and Bot1, the Aura's controller, nothing. Bot1's own Forest, not enchanted, taps for {G} alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mountain
Utopia Sprawl
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Island x30

